      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present an elevated, half-acre site off Priory Road, this charming semi-detached cottage offers a truly private and picturesque setting just moments from Delgany Village. \r\n\r\nFull planning permission is in place for a substantial two-storey extension, bringing the total accommodation to approximately 202.40 sq.m. and creating a spacious four-bedroom family home, including a stunning master suite with en-suite and walk-in wardrobe at attic level. Significant groundworks have already been completed — including rising walls, a radon barrier, and connection to the main sewerage system — giving a valuable head start to any purchaser ready to bring their vision to life.\r\n\r\nWhile substantial work remains to complete the build, as reflected in the accompanying photographs, this represents an exceptional opportunity for a discerning buyer to finish a home entirely to their own specification and taste. \r\n\r\nCombining an unbeatable location with genuine scope for customisation, this is a rare chance to create a dream home in one of Wicklow's most sought-after settings.\r\n\r\nDelgany village and Greystones town is a stroll away offering a wonderful selection of cafes, restaurants, boutiques, and shops as well as a large number of highly regarded schools.\r\n\r\nA host of sport and leisure clubs abound in the area including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA. \r\n\r\nThe Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool is close by, as are a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nGreystones is situated in a stunning location between the coast and the Wicklow mountains, giving easy access to the local beaches, countryside and nearby villages of Delgany, Kilcoole and Enniskerry.\r\n\r\nThe commuter will be delighted at the easy access to local bus services and Greystones DART station which offers Park & Ride facilities. The N11/M50 is also within easy reach making for an easy commute to the city, airport and beyond. \r\n\r\nWorks completed to date:\r\nFoundations installed and inspected. Concrete strip foundations.\r\nRising walls and radcon barriers installed and inspected.\r\nConcrete ground floors completed and inspected.\r\nFoul drainage connected.\r\nTimber joists First floor partially complete.\r\nExternal and internal walls partially complete.\r\nRoof timbers and felt partially complete.\r\n\r\nWorks not completed to date:\r\n \r\nRoof structure to be completed.\r\nRoof finishes to be completed.\r\nExternal walls, windows and doors to be completed.\r\nInternal walls to be completed.\r\nExternal wall finishes to be completed.\r\nInternal wall and ceiling finishes to be completed.\r\nDrainage surface water to be completed per condition 4(b) of planning permission.\r\nElectric installations.\r\nThermal insulation.\r\nFire and disability Aspects.\r\nSpace and water heating system.\r\nVentilation.\r\nHeating.\r\nDormer walls.\r\nThermal Bridging.\r\nLighting.\r\nAll pipework and tanks to be fully insulated.\r\nAttic insulation and provision of airtight attic hatch.\r\nPlanning Condition 2 contribution to be paid.\r\nPlanning condition 3 (a) and (b) to be constructed.\r\n\r\nSPECIAL FEATURES\r\nEnviable location of Priory Road in Delgany\r\nC.1/2 acre site with south and West orientation\r\nOpportunity for discerning purchaser to complete the home of their dreams to their own personal taste and specifications \r\nAll main services provided including mains sewage connection \r\nDelgany Village less than 1km\r\nGreystones town and Harbour Marina only a short drive\r\nN11 only 2km away\r\nBeautiful walks around Blackberry Lane strolling distance away\r\nEden Gate Centre less than 1 km away\r\nPotential for A rated BER certificate\r\nFull planning permission granted\r\nUnderfloor heating\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nA welcoming entrance hall with level access, creating an immediate sense of space and flow. The hall provides access to the living room.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nA beautifully proportioned reception room positioned to the front of the property. This elegant room enjoys excellent natural light through its large picture window and offers a wonderful space for both everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\nThe impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area forms the centrepiece of the home. Designed with modern family living in mind, the kitchen offers an abundance of potential of worktop and storage space together with a generous dining area capable of comfortably accommodating a large dining table. The layout flows effortlessly into the adjoining family room while sliding doors open directly onto the patio and landscaped garden, seamlessly blending indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nFamily Room \r\nA superb dual-purpose reception room flooded with natural light from its large sliding doors overlooking the rear garden. This spacious room provides the ideal setting for relaxing with family while enjoying direct access to the outdoor entertaining area.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nA practical utility room to be fitted with additional storage and plumbing for laundry appliances, offering valuable everyday convenience while keeping household tasks separate from the main living areas.\r\n\r\nShower Room \r\nA stylish ground floor shower room incorporating a contemporary suite which will comprise of a shower enclosure, wash hand basin and WC. \r\n\r\nWC \r\nA well-appointed family bathroom to be fitted with bath, wash hand basin and WC, finished to a high standard.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nA spacious double bedroom overlooking the rear of the property with excellent floor space for wardrobes and additional furniture.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nA generous double bedroom positioned to the front of the home, offering excellent proportions and ample space for fitted or freestanding wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\nA well-proportioned double bedroom ideal as a guest room, children's bedroom or home office, depending on individual requirements.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nA bright landing area with Velux roof windows providing excellent natural light and access to the luxurious principal suite.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Front\r\nGravel or alternative finish driveway, grass lawn, mature hedging.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Rear\r\nGravel patio or alternative finish, grass lawn, mature hedging."
      },
